% Generate pdd/cloud_server/models.py with Pydantic request models.

Use camelCase aliases, populate_by_name, extra=forbid, and JsonValue for arbitrary JSON.
Keep snake_case internal fields. Follow the exact fields in the HTTP contract.
Bound session/command IDs and command types to 128 characters, project paths to 4096,
session names to 256, language to 128, and example search input to one million.
Validate strength 0..1, temperature 0..2, time 0..1 or null, with finite numbers only.
Defaults: strength .5, temperature 0, time .25, verbose false, language python.
GenerateTest requires exactly one codeContent/example in generate mode.
Increase mode requires codeContent, existingTests, and coverageReport.
LLMInvoke requires prompt or messages; accept prompt inputs or batches and message batches.
Accept outputSchema, useBatchMode, and optional language.
Command payload.args and payload.options must be JSON objects when present.
CommandUpdate only accepts processing, completed, failed, or cancelled.

